<title>ZIMBABWE: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE BEAT FINLAND IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE BEAT FINLAND IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat Finland 4-1 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one play-off after</p>
<p>sharing the reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Zimbabwe names first):</p>
<p>Byron Black beat Tapio Nurminen 6-7 (7-9) 6-4 6-3 </p>
<p>Genius Chidzikwe lost to Vilio Liukko 1-6 6-7 (1-7)</p>
</text>
